    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Import WF03 → WF02 → WF01\n1. Select your MQTT credential in MQTT Trigger.\n2. Select 02_AI_DECISION_ENGINE_V2 in Run Decision Engine.\n3. Backend URLs default to http://host.docker.internal:3001 (n8n Docker, backend on host).\n4. Disable old WF01 before activating this one; do not run two MQTT ingestion flows.\n\nValidation covers malformed JSON, wrong types, room A101 and sensor ranges. Existing backend needs no schema change. Raw invalid payload is preserved as text inside error_reason (truncated to 6000 chars); a dedicated raw_payload API field is a future improvement.\n\nPOST requests are not automatically retried: current API has no idempotency key. Backend outage remains a failed execution, not a false success.\nlight_percent is inverted ADC percentage, not lux.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 680
      },
